    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nehemia kūlomba aje Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu ng'weji gwa Nisani, ng'waka gwa makūmi abīlī gwa būsugi wa ntemi Atashasta, aho yenhwa divai nīsola nūkantengela ū ntemi. Naalī nataalī kūbi nalī na būpīna ū kū būtongi bokwe nūūlū kamò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū ntemi ūnibūūja, “Bebe ni kinehe ilelo ūzoobaalile gīko alīyo ūtī nsaatu? Ū gwenūyū gūtūdūla kūbiza mhayo gūngī, ūlū ītī būpīna bo mu ng'holò!” Nakogoha no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nūng'wīla ū ntemi, “Kūlaga ūhangame ntemi! Nakūlekela kī ū kūpīnīhala alīyo ū nzengo go ng'wise ūko balaalile bataale bane gūlī mamisaka gike, nī mibita yago yapemvwa moto!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūnibūūja, “Ī gīsī lūūlū ūlū kwīta mhayo kī?” Nane nūnomba ū Mulungu wa ng'wigūlū, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna nūnshokeja ū ntemi, “Ūlū gūlībeelela ū mu miso ga ntemi, hama ū ntūmami wako ūlū wīlūkīlagwa wiza ū kū būtongi wako, nitūmage naje ī Būyudaya, ū kū nzengo gwa mashigo ga bakūlūgenji bane; nakagūzenge.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū ngole nang'hwe walī igashije hamò nū ntemi; hūna ū ntemi ūnibūūja, “Ū lūgendo lwako lūkūbiza lwa shikū jinga, ūkūshoka nanalī?” Ū ntemi walī atogilwe ū kūnizunīlīja ū kūja, na lūūlū nūng'winha ī likanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūng'wīla na, “Ūlū alīzunya ū ntemi, nalīlomba ninhwe nyalūba ja kūjana ū kū basugi ba sī ījo jilī kū nkīlo gwa mongo, natizūpandīka makoye ūlū nalībīta, kūshisha nashike ī Būyudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napandīke na nyalūba ya kūntwalīla ū Asafu, ū nang'hani w'ipoolu lya ntemi, anizunīlīje kūpandīka mitī kūlwa migamba, ya kūtūūla ha mibita ī ya ha ndugu īyo īpīndīlīgije hekalu, na kūlwa ndugu ya nzengo, na kūbeeja numba īyo nalikale ū nene.” Ū ntemi ūnizunīlīja īyo nakīlomba, nguno ū nkono gwawiza ū go ng'wa Mulungu wane gwalī hamò nane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nūja, aho nashika ū kū basugi ba sī ja kū nkīlo gwa mongo nūbinha ī nyalūba ja kūfuma ū kūlī ntemi. Nīyo ū ntemi walī waninha na bashilikale, na badamhīji ba falasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Sanibalati, ū muna Holoni, nū Tobia ū muna Amoni ūyo walī ntūmami, aho bigwa gīko, bakasaaya no ū kūbona gīkī wizile munhū kūbeeja nīmo gwa kūbagunanha a Baisilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nehemia kūlīngūlīla ndugu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanoga nūshikīīla ī Yelusalemu, aho nikala ikanza lya shikū idatū, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nūbūka mu makanza ga būjikū, na banhū bagehu naalī nabo. Gwike naalī nataalī kūng'wīla munhū ose ose īsho walī washitūūla ū Mulungu wane ū mu ng'holò yane kūlwa kwīyītīla ī Yelusalemu. Nīyo naalī natī na ndamhī ja kwigela, ūlū ītī īyo naalī nadamhīlile dūhū ū nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nabūka ū mu būjikū wenūbo, nūfuma hanze kūbītīla ha mita gwa kū longa, gwa kūbīta ūjile kū lwinzī lwa nyamhawa, na kū mita gwa mapalala. Najilīngūlīlaga ī ndugu ja nzengo gwa Yelusalemu ūmo jalī jakambagūlīlwa, nī mibita yaho īyo yalī yapemvwa moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma a henaho nūjīlīīla kū mita gwa kū lūzwīlo, na kwilambo lya ntemi; gwike gūgaya ū ng'wanya gwa kūbīta ī ndamhī yane īyo naalī nadamhīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū nūsīngīja nalūlondeelile ū longa ītaalī būjikū gīko, kūnū nakwīlīngūlīlaga ī ndugu; nanoga nūshokanya niza ningīlīla kū mita gwa kū longa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A basugi baalī batamanile ūko naalī naja, nūūlū īyo nīyītaga, nguno kūshisha ikanza lyenīlo naalī nataalī ū kūbawīla a Bayudaya nūūlū a bagabīji na a batongeeji, nūūlū a basugi; pye a bose nūūlū abo yalī gīkī bakūgwīta ū nīmo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nehemia kūfunya iganiko lyakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nūbawīla, “Bing'we angū mulībona gīkī tūlī mu makoye ahene; ī Yelusalemu īlī mamisaka gike, nī mibita yaho yapemvwa moto, twīzengagi ī ndugu ya Yelusalemu, twīnge ū mu būdalahwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nūbinha ī ng'hūlū ja nkono gwawiza ū go ng'wa Mulungu wane ūyo gwalī hamò nane, nī mihayo īyo walī waniwīla ū ntemi. Būhaya, “Twandyagi ū kūzenga.” Na ng'hana biyinha nguzu, bandya ū kūgwīta ū nīmo gwawiza gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Sanibalati, ū muna Holoni, nū Tobia, ū muna Amoni ūyo walī ntūmami, hamò na Geshemu, ū Ng'walabu, aho bigwa gīko bandya kwiyineenelegeja bakūtūsekaga mu būdalahi. Būyūhaya, “Mulīīta nīmo kī ū gwenūyū? Mulīngomela ū ntemi a bing'we?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nane nūbashokeja nūbawīla, “Ū Mulungu wa ng'wigūlū akūtwinha būtindi, a bise batūmami bakwe tūkwandya ū kūzenga; alīyo a bing'we mutī na ngabo gete, nūūlū shikolo shing'we ndūhū, shitīho nūūlū shose shose sha kūng'wīta ng'wizūkīlwe ū mu Yelusalemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
